 - Modified `getActiveFilterCount()` to only count status filters when they differ from the default ACTIVE selection
- **Impact**: The filter count badge only shows when users have applied filters beyond the default active status

### 4. **Improved Filter Panel Closing**
- **File**: `CowsScreen.kt`
- **Change**: Added a "Done" button in the top-right corner of the filter panel header
- **Impact**: Users now have a clear, intuitive way to close the filter panel without having to tap the filter button again

